# Two straights and two semicircles create a geometrically closed oval.
name "Club Circuit"
description "A short, flowing oval for learning the grip limit and chasing laps."
width 13
start 0 0 0
straight 140
checkpoint
right 90 radius 55 bank -14
right 90 radius 55 bank 0
checkpoint
straight 140
checkpoint
right 90 radius 55 bank -14
right 90 radius 55 bank 0
close
